<title>USA: Megalith hires financial adviser.</title>
<headline>Megalith hires financial adviser.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Megalith Corp said Tuesday it has hired Brooks, Houghton &amp; Co Inc as its financial adviser and investment banking firm.</p>
<p>Megalith's wholly owned subsidiary, Esco Elevator Corp, is a designer, manufacturer and marketer of hydraulic elevators.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
